OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FGianni Infantino has apologised for
OL,8,Fthe "errors" over his scrapped plan to
OL,9,Fintroduce private investment to the
OL,10,FWorld Cup as he sought to move past
OL,11,Fthe crisis and reaffirm his leadership
OL,12,Fof Fifa.
OL,14,FIn a letter signed by Infantino and
OL,15,FFifa General Secretary Mattias
OL,16,FGrafstrom, seen by ITV News, the pair
OL,17,Fsay: "We sincerely apologise for these
OL,18,Ferrors and commit to them not
OL,19,Fhappening again."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
