OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786049274
OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FInfantino faced immense criticism over
OL,8,Fhis plans to sell stakes in a World
OL,9,FCup company to private investors under
OL,10,Fthe Fifa Forward Enterprise proposal.
OL,12,FThe plans were rejected by three
OL,13,Fcontinental confederations, while Uefa
OL,14,Fthreatened to boycott the World Cup
OL,15,Fand other Fifa competitions if the
OL,16,Fproposal went ahead.
OL,18,FThe letter seen by ITV News shows
OL,19,FInfantino's first attempts to move
OL,20,Fpast the crisis saying.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786049274
OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,F"With the project withdrawn, Fifa will
OL,8,Fno longer tolerate any attacks on its
OL,9,Fintegrity, good governance and due
OL,10,Fprocess and will take all necessary
OL,11,Fmeasures to protect and safeguard its
OL,12,Fname and reputation," he said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786049274
OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FDuring the height of the crisis,
OL,8,Fseveral senior Fifa staff openly
OL,9,Fcriticised Infantino's leadership,
OL,10,Fwith Fifa's chief operating officer,
OL,11,FKevin Lamour, saying Infantino had
OL,12,F"deceived" Fifa's staff in planning
OL,13,Fthe private investor scheme and
OL,14,F"deserve better than contempt and
OL,15,Fintimidation".
OL,17,FBut on Wednesday Fifa reaffirmed its
OL,18,Fsupport for Infantino after an
OL,19,Femergency meeting in Rabat, Morocco,
OL,20,Fof all the organisation's leadership.
OL,26,@vD@AOUwD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786049274
OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FAfter the meeting, Fifa issued a
OL,8,Fstatement reaffirming its "full
OL,9,Fsupport" for Infantino.
OL,11,FThe statement said: "Following a
OL,12,Fmeeting in Rabat, Morocco, the Fifa
OL,13,Fsecretary general and members of the
OL,14,FFifa management board in attendance
OL,15,Freaffirmed their full support for Fifa
OL,16,Fpresident Gianni Infantino, as the
OL,17,Fonly official elected by the 211 Fifa
OL,18,Fmember associations.
OL,26,@sD@UOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786049274
OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,F"In turn, the Fifa president
OL,8,Freiterated his full support for the
OL,9,FFifa secretary general and the Fifa
OL,10,Fadministration for their necessary and
OL,11,Foutstanding work in the delivery of
OL,12,Fhis vision."
OL,14,FInfantino scrapped the plans on
OL,15,FSaturday, but the scandal has left his
OL,16,Fleadership weakened just as he was
OL,17,Fstarting the process to get confirmed
OL,18,Ffor a fourth term as Fifa president.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
