OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786049274
OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FThe England and Welsh Football
OL,8,FAssociations have both withdrawn their
OL,9,Fsupport for his leadership.
OL,11,FUefa also said it had "lost
OL,12,Fconfidence" in him.
OL,14,FOther national associations are also
OL,15,Funderstood to still be furious with
OL,16,FInfantino.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
