OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786049274
OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FPrior to Wednesday's statement,
OL,8,Fmembers of the Fifa Council were
OL,9,Funderstood to be working to achieve
OL,10,Fthe majority of 19 needed to request
OL,11,FInfantino to convene an extraordinary
OL,12,Fgeneral meeting.
OL,14,FThere, he could be held to account
OL,15,Fover FFE, and also the Folarin Balogun
OL,16,Fcase, which had hugely upset some
OL,17,Fmembers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
