OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FCouncil members are understood to
OL,13,Fremain committed to forcing a
OL,14,F'governance boycott' if they cannot
OL,15,Freach the majority, or if they do
OL,16,Freach the majority and Infantino
OL,17,Frefuses the request to hold a meeting.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
