OL,3,CInfantino apologises for 'errors' in
OL,4,Cletter after failed Fifa investment
OL,5,Cscheme
OL,7,FCouncillors intend to stay away from
OL,8,Fmeetings if this is not properly
OL,9,Faddressed ` effectively incapacitating
OL,10,FFIFA operations ` such is their anger
OL,11,Fat Infantino's conduct.
OL,13,FDespite all the anger at his
OL,14,Fleadership, Infantino appears to be
OL,15,Fcarrying on with every intention of
OL,16,Fsecuring his next term, with the
OL,17,Felection due in March.
OL,19,FHe is due to attend the inauguration
OL,20,Fof Colombia's new president, Abelardo
OL,21,Fde la Espriella, on Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
